     "value": "With over six years of experience as a dental assistant, I hold both my Certificate III and Certificate IV in Dental Assisting and have a genuine passion for helping patients feel comfortable and confident in their smiles. I love being part of a team that makes a positive difference in people’s lives and helping patients feel at ease throughout their dental journey. Having lived in different places, I’ve always enjoyed experiencing new surroundings and embracing new adventures. I’m very excited to explore everything Warrnambool has to offer and to make it my home!"
